---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-brand-200 bg-brand-900 text-brand-100">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-white">Bent Grass Neighborhood</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-brand-200">
          A volunteer-led community resource for Bent Grass / Falcon Meadows, in unincorporated El Paso County, Colorado.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-300">Contact</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href="mailto:bentgrassneighborhood@gmail.com">bentgrassneighborhood@gmail.com</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href="tel:+17194011119">(719) 401-1119</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/bentgrassmeadows" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook Group</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-300">
          <a class="hover:text-white" href="/site-info">Site Info</a>
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href="/site-info/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href="/site-info/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href="/site-info/neutrality-policy">Neutrality Policy</a></li>
          <li>
            <a class="hover:text-white" href="https://github.com/BrendonKing32/bentgrass-community-website-issues/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Report a broken link</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 border-t border-brand-800 pt-6 text-xs text-brand-300">
      <p>
        This is an unofficial, volunteer-run community website. Nothing here is legal advice. Information may be
        incomplete, out of date, or inaccurate — always verify with the official source before relying on it.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2">&copy; {year} Bent Grass Neighborhood. Run by neighbors, for neighbors.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
